=== BDD-3: syntax-error command string -> judge exit 1 (not 0) ===
--- english locale: real bash syntax error ---
bash exit=2 (expect 2)
bash: -c: line 1: unexpected EOF while looking for matching `"'
--- chinese locale: real bash syntax error ---
bash exit=2 (expect 2)
bash: -c: 行 1: 寻找匹配的 `"' 时遇到了未预期的 EOF
--- judge english (exit2 + zero runner stats + syntax文案 -> exit 1) ---
TDD_CHECK: A-class error (command string itself has syntax error, runner never started)
judge exit=1 (expect 1, must NOT be 0)
judge-en check exit=0 (expect 0)
--- judge chinese (exit2 + zero runner stats + 中文文案 -> exit 1) ---
TDD_CHECK: A-class error (command string itself has syntax error, runner never started)
judge exit=1 (expect 1, must NOT be 0)
judge-zh check exit=0 (expect 0)
EXIT_CODE: 0
